  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Denna granskning &#xe4;r en del av uppf&#xf6;ljningen av alla SRK medel, som    kanaliseras genom IFRC, f&#xf6;r att s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lla att dessa hanteras i      enlighet med kraven i avtalen och att de anv&#xe4;nds f&#xf6;r avsett &#xe4;ndam&#xe5;l.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This audit is a part of following-up on all SRC funds, which are      channelled through the IFRC, to ensure that these are handled in      accordance with the requirements in the agreements and that they are  used for intended purposes.</narrative>
